83
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,399
Understood?

84
00:08:22,399 --> 00:08:23,000
Understood.

85
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:23,600
Understood?

86
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,319
Understood.

87
